origin/master invoicePdfBuilder.ts:34 is `LEFT JOIN customers c ON c.id = COALESCE(ci.client_id, ci.customer_id)` with no `c.company_id = ci.company_id`. The invoice itself is scoped (`ci.company_id = companyId`, :39) and master already scopes the projects join (:37); the customer join is the gap. `customer_invoices.client_id` has no FK, so nothing in the schema stops a foreign id. K-091 adds the predicate on its branch. Impact SQL: SELECT count(*) FROM customer_invoices ci JOIN customers c ON c.id = COALESCE(ci.client_id, ci.customer_id) WHERE c.company_id <> ci.company_id;

SEVERITY RAISED 2026-09-10 after measurement in the disposable fixture (built from the same migrations as production; production itself not queried): customers and customer_invoices have relrowsecurity=true and relforcerowsecurity=true, policy tenant_isolation FOR ALL TO app_user USING (company_id IN (SELECT auth.user_companies())); app_user is neither superuser nor BYPASSRLS; postgres is both; production's DATABASE_URL user is postgres. The portal route can only work by bypassing RLS — as app_user with no user claim, auth.user_companies() is empty and the invoice itself would be hidden — so it necessarily runs unprotected. Fix components: (1) K-091 adds c.company_id = ci.company_id to the PDF join (closes the disclosure once merged AND deployed); (2) R-067 — the ownership check, not on any branch; (3) consider running portal routes under a role scoped to the token's company rather than as superuser.

FIXED ON MASTER 2026-09-10 by K-091 (PR #414, master e86b10664): the customer join now carries `AND c.company_id = ci.company_id`. Closes the disclosure; the create-path hole is R-067 (in progress). NOT deployed — production still runs the unfixed code until a master deploy. 2026-09-26: verified LIVE at prod RELEASE_SHA 34dac5651 (it was first live at or before that SHA; the earliest deploy was not traced). Every recorded fix commit is an ancestor of 34dac5651, and the guard is present in the code at that SHA (git show, not disk): PDF customer join carries AND c.company_id = ci.company_id (invoicePdfBuilder.ts:39); fix commit e86b10664 (#414) is an ancestor. Schema parts ride migrations that deploy.sh applies before rsync; prod DB not queried.
